lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为发布开源盘古大模型2.0，参数规模最高达505B</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">中央网信办上线涉AI应用乱象举报专区，明确受理14类违规问题</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Perplexity联合哈佛商学院发布研究报告：AI Agent显著提升知识工作效率</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">高盛发布AI行业研报：预计2030年全球AI Token消耗量将暴涨24倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e26643a43129bdbbdcfe0c1cd3cd603b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">高盛发布最新AI行业研报指出，市场严重低估了AI基础设施需求，预计2027年超大规模数据中心运营商的AI资本支出将达1.1万亿美元，乐观场景下甚至增至1.4万亿美元，远超华尔街预期的9200亿美元。受企业级AI Agent普及驱动，高盛预测2030年全球AI Token消耗量将增长24倍，这将持续拉动芯片、网络设备及电力等基础设施需求。研报判断，AI行业供需失衡状态将至少持续至2027年下半年。同时，高盛提示了行业潜在风险：AI工具的实际效率转化尚待验证，内存、电力及人力等物理资源短缺已导致部分数据中心项目延期，且AI基建相关个股估值快速走高，脱离盈利基本面，市场波动风险加大。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">母亲起诉OpenAI：聊天机器人是否成为压垮女儿的“最后一根稻草”？</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">母亲起诉OpenAI：聊天机器人是否成为压垮女儿的“最后一根稻草”。AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 12, 2026130在人工智能技术高速发展的背后，一场关于伦理与责任的深刻争议正在法律界引发震动。近日，一名加拿大母亲克里斯蒂·卡里尔（Kristie Carrier）正式在美国加利福尼亚州提起诉讼，将矛头直指OpenAI及其首席执行官萨姆·奥尔特曼，指控其旗下的聊天机器人ChatGPT在诱导其女儿自杀事件中负有不可推卸的责任。据了解，悲剧发生于去年，年仅 24 岁的爱丽丝（Alice）不幸离世。诉讼文件披露了一段令人心碎的事实：在生前的一段时间里，爱丽丝曾多次尝试与ChatGPT交流，表达自己强烈的自杀念头。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为发布开源盘古大模型2.0，参数规模最高达505B</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在华为开发者大会（HDC 2026）上，华为常务董事、终端BG董事长余承东正式发布开源盘古大模型2.0。该版本参数规模最高达到505B，标志着华为在模型生态兼容性与实用效能上的重大突破。余承东表示，华为自大模型早期阶段便已布局，在去年接手业务后，团队克服算力储备限制，实现了技术架构与性能的全面迭代。此次盘古2.0的发布是华为构建鸿蒙生态的关键举措，旨在通过开源赋能更广泛的行业应用，为开发者提供强劲的底层技术支撑。余承东强调，华为将依托全栈技术能力持续赶超，致力于构建更具竞争力的AI生态，并向人工智能技术制高点发起冲锋。此次更新不仅展示了华为在AI领域的坚定投入，也为开发者提供了更具竞争力的模型选择，将进一步推动大模型在各行业的落地与应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">中央网信办上线涉AI应用乱象举报专区，明确受理14类违规问题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d36b3935046a5c96dc2142c5228ca4c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">中央网信办举报中心于本月正式上线“涉AI应用乱象举报专区”，旨在配合“清朗·整治AI应用乱象”专项行动，规范AI产品与服务。此次举报受理范围涵盖14类违规问题，分为两大板块。AI应用服务违规方面，重点关注大模型未备案、安全审核能力欠缺、训练语料安全隐患、AI数据投毒、合成内容未标注、滥用技术违法及开源模型管理疏漏。AI信息内容乱象方面，涵盖利用AI篡改内容、编造虚假信息、AI仿冒他人、制作暴力低俗内容、侵害未成年人权益、开展网络水军活动及各类产品违规行为。官方呼吁公众积极参与监督，通过该渠道举报违规乱象，以推动AI产业健康有序发展，保障网民合法权益。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Perplexity联合哈佛商学院发布研究报告：AI Agent显著提升知识工作效率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3095e7d03a039bfc01cadfa9be8bdeaa.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Perplexity联合哈佛商学院发布最新研究报告，对比Perplexity Computer通用AI智能体编排器与传统搜索助手，揭示了AI Agent在知识工作领域的变革性影响。研究显示，AI Agent具备自主任务规划与执行能力，单次会话平均自主运行时长达26分钟，是传统搜索助手33秒的48倍。在效率与成本方面，AI Agent使任务完成时间减少79%至92%，综合成本降低87%至96%，其中编程领域优化效果最显著。与传统AI助手仅能解答问题不同，AI Agent通过跨平台调用工具实现全流程自动化。该研究指出，AI Agent正在重塑职场形态，用户角色正从一线操作员向工作监督者转变，未来将进一步影响岗位划分、人员配置及团队架构。这一技术进步不仅提升了单体任务效率，更拓宽了知识工作的边界，使从业者能够承接更高</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
